CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS "Library" ("id" UUID PRIMARY KEY,"tenantId" UUID NOT NULL,"schoolId" UUID NOT NULL,"name" TEXT NOT NULL,"active" BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT true,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,"updatedAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CONSTRAINT "Library_tenantId_schoolId_name_key" UNIQUE("tenantId","schoolId","name"));
CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS "Library_tenantId_schoolId_active_idx" ON "Library"("tenantId","schoolId","active");
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS "LibraryBook" ("id" UUID PRIMARY KEY,"tenantId" UUID NOT NULL,"schoolId" UUID NOT NULL,"libraryId" UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES "Library"("id") ON DELETE CASCADE,"title" TEXT NOT NULL,"author" TEXT NOT NULL,"isbn" TEXT,"category" TEXT,"status" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'ACTIVE',"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,"updatedAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CONSTRAINT "LibraryBook_libraryId_isbn_key" UNIQUE("libraryId","isbn"));
CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS "LibraryBook_tenantId_schoolId_libraryId_status_idx" ON "LibraryBook"("tenantId","schoolId","libraryId","status");
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS "LibraryCopy" ("id" UUID PRIMARY KEY,"tenantId" UUID NOT NULL,"schoolId" UUID NOT NULL,"libraryId" UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES "Library"("id") ON DELETE CASCADE,"bookId" UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES "LibraryBook"("id") ON DELETE CASCADE,"barcode" TEXT NOT NULL,"status" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'AVAILABLE',"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CONSTRAINT "LibraryCopy_libraryId_barcode_key" UNIQUE("libraryId","barcode"));
CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS "LibraryCopy_tenantId_schoolId_libraryId_status_idx" ON "LibraryCopy"("tenantId","schoolId","libraryId","status");
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS "LibraryLoan" ("id" UUID PRIMARY KEY,"tenantId" UUID NOT NULL,"schoolId" UUID NOT NULL,"libraryId" UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES "Library"("id") ON DELETE CASCADE,"copyId" UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES "LibraryCopy"("id") ON DELETE RESTRICT,"borrowerId" UUID NOT NULL,"status" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'BORROWED',"borrowedAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,"dueAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL,"returnedAt" TIMESTAMP(3));
CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS "LibraryLoan_tenantId_schoolId_libraryId_status_dueAt_idx" ON "LibraryLoan"("tenantId","schoolId","libraryId","status","dueAt");
